{{!
    @template enrol_apply/info

    Read-only listing of the comments submitted with enrolment applications.

    The table markup is produced by table_sql and passed in already rendered, so it is
    output with a triple stash.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * tablehtml string - pre-rendered applications table

    Example context (json):
    {
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>Student 1</td><td>Please let me in</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_apply-info">
    {{{tablehtml}}}
</div>
